{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >July 22nd, 22:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hayato's life is taken by an unknown assailant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using his &quot;Return by Death&quot; ability to escape this fatal destiny, he hunts down the mysterious figure who keeps killing him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Hayato will come to learn...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...for whose sake this endless loop of death was created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven, first-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystery where you repeat a death loop to uncover the truth behind the incident and the enigmatic figure who relentlessly murders the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various trials and errors utilizing the death loop:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you run far away?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you hide in the wardrobe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you get a gun and fight back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you doubt your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you kill everyone around the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 3-6 hours (depending on playstyle).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc Streaming and SNS Posting Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals and corporations alike may stream this game without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is permitted only through the functions provided by the video streaming platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the game's title in your video or stream title, and include a link to the Steam page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, we assume no responsibil